# Bind-mounted into the madscientist container at /secrets/ (read-only).
# Used to hold:
#   * gmail_oauth.json - Google OAuth client_secret + access/refresh token
#     for the email bridge's inbound thread reader.
#   * Any future Slack / Discord webhook tokens, etc.
#
# CRITICAL: nothing in here should ever land in git. If you accidentally
# commit a secret here, ROTATE IT immediately (a removed-from-git secret
# is still in the git history; rotation is the only fix).

*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
